Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.84,0:00:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.94,0:00:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.68,0:00:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.56,0:00:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.66,0:00:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.36,0:00:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.56,0:01:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till someone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.20,0:01:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all, through\Nall the trouble of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.52,0:01:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.34,0:01:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.26,0:01:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.30,0:01:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.42,0:01:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.94,0:01:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.18,0:01:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.76,0:01:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.14,0:01:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on a cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.40,0:01:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He destroyed the fin!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.40,0:02:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's trying to sink my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.32,0:02:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dare defy me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.84,0:02:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dean, blow his head off right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.28,0:02:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.36,0:02:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.68,0:02:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he saved our lives when we were starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.34,0:02:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He gave us food.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.34,0:02:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I don't see why you're all so upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.24,0:02:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't sink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.42,0:02:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back off, sure boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.16,0:02:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not your fight, but I\Nwill what I'm going to sink it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.26,0:02:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard, that's what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.68,0:02:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't sink this shit,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.44,0:02:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if the restaurant's gone There's\Nno reason to attack then, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.04,0:02:53.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.66,0:02:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ship saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.96,0:03:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I owe everything to her, and\Nyou will not take that away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna die for\Na dumb old restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.88,0:03:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.52,0:03:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.90,0:03:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.00,0:03:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how you want to repay your debt?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.76,0:03:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The old man didn't save you so\Nthat you could kill yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.38,0:03:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it so you could do\Nsomething with your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.98,0:03:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to die like a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.38,0:03:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so your big idea is\Nto help them attack us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.34,0:03:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boys, there's no need\Nfor friends to fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.96,0:03:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially when there's\Nnothing either of you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.72,0:03:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not while there's a big shotgun
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.52,0:03:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pressed right up against\Nthe old man's chef's hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.58,0:03:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your problem began when you decided\Nto come up against the Krieg pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.48,0:03:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire, Pearl!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.64,0:03:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you will burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.16,0:04:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.07,0:04:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.08,0:04:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ginny?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.99,0:04:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.16,0:04:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.48,0:04:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ginny!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.39,0:04:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have betrayed your\Ncaptain and your ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.96,0:04:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Dorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.24,0:04:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he saved our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.82,0:04:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.90,0:04:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.81,0:04:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He deserves better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.18,0:04:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He deserves to face death standing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.12,0:04:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I promise you, he'll\Nstill die by my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.78,0:04:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.08,0:04:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My chief commander has now\Ncompletely lost his marbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.68,0:04:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's their chief commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.90,0:04:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.40,0:04:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see him crush that guy, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.24,0:04:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One blow and his shield was in pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.84,0:04:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.74,0:04:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My plan worked perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.76,0:04:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now he's out in the open.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.20,0:05:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.12,0:05:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way you thought\Nthat this would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.02,0:05:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.16,0:05:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't want to ruin this ship,\Nbut I think it's too late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.08,0:05:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to get to this\Nrestaurant without killing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.90,0:05:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got another thing coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.50,0:05:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.64,0:05:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it will be an absolute\Npleasure to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.92,0:05:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My good friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.08,0:05:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, that's comforting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.54,0:05:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You as well, chore boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.60,0:05:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, thanks, but I'm not\Nafraid of any Krieg pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.98,0:05:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little dwarf!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.46,0:05:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm right here ready to die, little man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.40,0:05:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna stuff that stupid\NStraw Hat right down your throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.66,0:05:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're the three pirates,\Nrulers of the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.60,0:05:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, only because you outnumbered\Nthe other pirates in the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.98,0:05:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh boy, now you really pissed\Nhim off. Guess I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.14,0:06:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dead meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.38,0:06:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.72,0:06:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold your place!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.74,0:06:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Don Krieg, he can't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.78,0:06:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You only prove his point when you lose\Ncontrol or whine like little babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.12,0:06:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see me trembling with anger?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.82,0:06:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only the weak react to mere words.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.12,0:06:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Donkreek pirates run from no man!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.72,0:06:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gain, it's your job to\Ntake care of that cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.64,0:06:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll handle the little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.18,0:06:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That brat is all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.34,0:06:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.54,0:06:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Don Krieg.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.52,0:06:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.10,0:06:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can try your devil\Nfruit magic against me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.90,0:06:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I've seen it all before and have\Nnever been defeated by such trickery.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.50,0:06:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you experience the full force\Nthat conquered the entire East Blue,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.98,0:06:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then you'll understand the\Nmeaning of power, chore boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.62,0:07:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your voice is getting on my nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.84,0:07:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.34,0:07:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as simple as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.78,0:07:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.92,0:07:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The impudence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.42,0:07:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That cook is done for now. Yeah, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.78,0:07:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Ginny takes out his weapons,\Nhe's through-screwing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.14,0:07:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.50,0:07:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They call him a cold-hearted demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.60,0:07:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's our cool-headed, cold-hearted\NPirate Fleet Chief Commander, Aokiji.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.86,0:07:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if you beg for mercy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.32,0:07:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he'll still laugh in your\Nface while he kills you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.64,0:07:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Sanji, but I can't be defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.70,0:07:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell yourself that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.58,0:07:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.90,0:08:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.16,0:08:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! You Sodom!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.06,0:08:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.46,0:08:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.24,0:08:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.34,0:08:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.25,0:08:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, it's time for\Nyou to accept defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.90,0:08:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.36,0:09:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That cook kicked Kaido in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.48,0:09:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I couldn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.72,0:09:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think he's still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.44,0:09:28.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.84,0:09:29.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.75,0:09:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all this time, you should know a\Nhell of a lot better than that, you idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.20,0:09:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a reason I trust him\Nabove any of my other pirate crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.38,0:09:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ginny is always a cool-headed,\Ncold-hearted demon, and he never quits!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.04,0:09:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Sanji is getting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.68,0:09:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He should lie back down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.38,0:09:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After what he's been through, his\Nribs must be completely smashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.50,0:10:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that wasn't too\Nbad, Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.86,0:10:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me know when you're\Nready to really fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.54,0:10:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just sitting there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.24,0:10:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's ass-kicking time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.18,0:10:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't hurt yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.40,0:10:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.08,0:10:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to fight me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.66,0:10:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.98,0:10:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I really have to?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.58,0:10:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If all I want to do is kill\Nyou, that's enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.76,0:11:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really don't have any patience\Nfor your stupid games little fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.78,0:11:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. How about I butt your head off?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.40,0:11:15.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.74,0:11:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.72,0:11:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pulverize the rest of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.50,0:11:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what he said! Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.10,0:11:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only he hadn't fought\Nthat pearl guy first!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.30,0:11:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't think you'll survive\Nanother hit from those balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.86,0:11:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.30,0:11:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hit like a girl anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.30,0:11:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's too strong for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.30,0:12:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.10,0:12:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that? Your pity?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.68,0:12:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not dead yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.16,0:12:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.54,0:12:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.74,0:12:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.72,0:12:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.86,0:12:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna kill himself\Njust trying to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.86,0:12:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.64,0:13:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't, Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.12,0:13:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.98,0:13:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.40,0:13:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.16,0:13:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.52,0:13:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.18,0:13:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it and leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.04,0:13:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.66,0:13:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.18,0:13:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.38,0:13:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it was over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:14:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I truly thought I was going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.76,0:14:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This food, it's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.60,0:14:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never eaten food this delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.52,0:14:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.12,0:14:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.03,0:14:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll probably get yelled at or fired\Nbecause you gave me that food for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.16,0:14:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now there's not proof, so there's\Nno way for me to get yelled at.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.28,0:14:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He treated me with such respect\Nand decency and kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.86,0:14:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I can't bring\Nmyself to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.06,0:14:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get caught again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.80,0:14:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always been loyal to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.40,0:14:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up till now, I've believed\Nin what we've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.52,0:14:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I respect you and appreciate\Nall you have given me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:15:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trusting me as your chief\Ncommander was the honor of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.74,0:15:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until this moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.26,0:15:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have obeyed every single order you have\Ngiven me without ever questioning it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.62,0:15:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't live with myself if I kill\Nthis man, and I cannot break my oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.78,0:15:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, I beg you, let me\Ndisobey just this one order.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.30,0:15:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Don Krieg.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.36,0:15:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, can't we just leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.56,0:15:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can keep the\Nrestaurant for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.46,0:15:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.50,0:15:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you can defy my orders\Nand then tell me what to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.84,0:15:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.00,0:15:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morality, sympathy, weaknesses I\Nnever expected to see from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.46,0:15:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are not my chief commander anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.24,0:16:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.10,0:16:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not the gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.72,0:16:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to use the MH5.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.78,0:16:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.24,0:16:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Who's in gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.66,0:16:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's my mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.02,0:16:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Masks on. Move it. Move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.86,0:16:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's using MH5.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.12,0:16:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gas is a coward's weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.58,0:16:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.49,0:16:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll kill us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.64,0:16:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing that matters in a battle
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.64,0:16:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is who ends up winning, even\Nif more have got to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.04,0:16:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poison gas is just a means to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.10,0:16:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.01,0:16:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Victory is all that decides\Nwhat's right and what's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.98,0:16:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you are dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.60,0:16:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nobody's gonna hear you complain anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.92,0:16:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you don't hesitate to do\Nunspeakable, horrible things,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.72,0:16:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that is true power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.70,0:16:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.10,0:17:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might as well throw that gas mask away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.74,0:17:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're no longer worthy\Nto be a Karoo pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.78,0:17:11.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.92,0:17:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let\Nthat happen, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.92,0:17:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wasting your time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.94,0:17:25.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tribute!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.98,0:17:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.28,0:17:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keen!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.24,0:17:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to listen to that blowhard,\Nbecause I'm going to kick his ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.94,0:17:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.86,0:17:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My captain cannot be defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.88,0:17:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg is the strongest man\Nalive, and I respect his punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.28,0:18:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you please snap out of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.52,0:18:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is going to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.30,0:18:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obeying my emotions meant\Nbetraying my captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.46,0:18:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were in his position, then\NI would have done the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.06,0:18:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, death is the\Nonly honor I have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.42,0:18:18.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,George!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.14,0:18:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.42,0:18:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heh, so you've remembered your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.20,0:18:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's much too late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.86,0:18:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you will both die together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.00,0:18:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the MH5!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.94,0:18:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poison, gas bomb, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.44,0:18:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get inside the restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.08,0:18:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.94,0:18:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Kaido! Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.36,0:18:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now for mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.62,0:18:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.52,0:19:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is power!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.62,0:19:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.14,0:19:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That mask appeared just in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.14,0:19:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a crazy bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.30,0:19:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He tried to kill us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.04,0:19:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy's gotta be insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.92,0:19:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he used poison gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.04,0:19:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must be a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.48,0:19:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No human would do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.96,0:20:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think Sanji and Shura\NBoy made it? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.06,0:20:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, the poison gas is clearing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.78,0:20:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.20,0:20:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.22,0:20:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can let go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.16,0:20:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Ginny, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.86,0:20:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your mask you gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.44,0:20:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a fool you are, paying for a\Nplate of food with your life, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.58,0:20:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well maybe you'll learn when you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.86,0:21:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ginny.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.76,0:21:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, it seems...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.64,0:21:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg was not the right\Nman for you to follow, was he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.80,0:21:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It figures that you still feel for\Nthat pathetic scum. Scum? That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.44,0:21:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone who loses focus and betrays\Nmy ship is worthless to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.38,0:21:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll almost certainly do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.76,0:21:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Putting him out of his misery\Nis an act of mercy to keep him
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.56,0:21:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from dishonoring himself in the\Nfuture and endangering my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.48,0:21:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he just...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.94,0:21:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought the captain\Nwould kill his chief commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.24,0:21:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.30,0:21:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gin is his right-hand man for even\Nlonger than I've been part of the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.10,0:21:56.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.01,0:22:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, no one's ever showed more loyalty to\NDon Krieg than Ginny has over the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.98,0:22:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could he forget what Ginny\Ndid for us after we escaped
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.08,0:22:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from the Grand Line and\Nfull-body's marines were after us?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.04,0:22:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a miracle we escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.76,0:22:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he was willing to sacrifice\Nhis life for us by acting as a decoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.50,0:22:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without him, we wouldn't\Nhave made it out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.14,0:22:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gein's laid down his life for\NDon Krieg a hundred times easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.54,0:22:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe the captain would\Nkill him with such little care.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.00,0:22:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.80,0:22:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patty, get the kit, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.96,0:22:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for food poisoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.82,0:22:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think it'll work on gas, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.06,0:22:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.97,0:22:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.00,0:22:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put the mask on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.16,0:22:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will detoxify the gas in his lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.80,0:22:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then bring him upstairs\Nand let him breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.08,0:22:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only chance we have to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.64,0:22:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patty, Carney, hurry. Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.28,0:22:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right already. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.66,0:22:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.06,0:22:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.20,0:23:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to die within the hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.42,0:23:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare die, Gin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.46,0:23:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't let someone like him win!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.06,0:23:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stick around, now I'm mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.26,0:23:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll want to see what I'm\Ngoing to do to him next!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.18,0:23:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't defeat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.38,0:23:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, attacking him\Nhead on is exactly what he wants!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.68,0:23:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's strongest that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.92,0:23:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not worried!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.34,0:23:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and give it your best shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.94,0:23:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dumb kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.34,0:23:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you lose your patience,\Nyou become easy prey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.68,0:23:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are only running toward\None thing, chore boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.84,0:23:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that is!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.24,0:23:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dead, really dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.34,0:23:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your funeral!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.78,0:23:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My funeral?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.64,0:23:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.55,0:23:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.50,0:24:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.66,0:24:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.62,0:24:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.00,0:24:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.91,0:24:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just try it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.20,0:24:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got no place to hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.56,0:24:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.70,0:24:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.76,0:24:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg is down!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.52,0:24:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That punk got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.00,0:24:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that kid, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.94,0:24:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He punched him right through the spanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.08,0:25:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.66,0:25:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen him get hit\Nin any kind of fight, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.44,0:25:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He busted right through that porcupine\Ncape and smashed him right in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.06,0:25:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.40,0:25:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So is this my funeral?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.54,0:25:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.68,0:25:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.58,0:25:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little spikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.76,0:25:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.76,0:25:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will take more than this!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.14,0:25:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to do better than that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.08,0:25:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you want to beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.30,0:25:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I don't think it's\Ntime for me to die just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.64,0:26:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know one thing. He's unhinged.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.90,0:26:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen one or two like him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.24,0:26:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stubborn kids who'd rather die than have
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.60,0:26:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to turn away from a\Nfight once it's started.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.76,0:26:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll stay that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.96,0:26:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad he's with us because\Nguys like that are hell to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.52,0:26:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care if he wins or loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.16,0:26:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I consider it an honor just to be able?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.56,0:26:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to watch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.56,0:27:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was in my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.04,0:27:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.56,0:27:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.98,0:27:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stop chasing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.48,0:27:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until it comes true.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.30,0:27:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if the world ever changes!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.26,0:27:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call out your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.48,0:27:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We return to the time when\Neverything's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.66,0:27:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with you,\Nmy memories won't fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.74,0:27:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiting for that one true dream?

